              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Macowe, wakinyalo medo ciro, am'omiyo waridho bedo kendi wan i Athen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kareno waoro Timothe, omin wan ma tiyo kodi wan ri Were i fonjo Wac Manyen Maber kwoŋ Kristo. Waoro go bongi win womiy win miseni gi konyo yeyo mewin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka moro kwoŋ win wokiri wogiki cen ro lweny me. Wiwegi wiŋeyo nike kiti lweny no obedo gima waripo luw'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole munyo fodi wanitie gi win wawaco riwin ma ndir fodi k'otundo nike ibino lwenyo gi wan, aka paka wiŋeyo maber, meno a gim'otimere won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno am'omiyo, munyo akinyalo ciro kendo, adhiro Timothe bino ŋeyo gima tho kwoŋ yeyo mewin. Oyido alworo ni ipoyo jakeli karatem otieko temo win, aka tic mawan onyo otho nono!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
